# Every permanent that reaches a battlefield plays its entry (the operator, 2026-11-11: "if they
# ever hit the board, all the effect should always happen consistently"). Seat 0 (human) casts
# Show and Tell ({2}{U}) with Griselbrand the only other card in hand; seat 1 (the AI) holds Hill
# Giant. Both are put onto the battlefield out of a hand, not cast: alice's from a hand her screen
# draws, the AI's from one it does not. `e2e/entry-everywhere.spec.ts` reads both entries.
turn=1
activeplayer=human
activephase=MAIN1
humanlife=20
ailife=20
humanhand=Show and Tell;Griselbrand
humanbattlefield=Island;Island;Island
humanlibrary=Island;Island;Island;Island;Island;Island
humangraveyard=
aihand=Hill Giant
aibattlefield=Mountain
ailibrary=Mountain;Mountain;Mountain;Mountain;Mountain;Mountain
